body: "The parity oracle in tests/oracle is pinned to @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.10.14 while the current release is 2026.10.19. Owner rule: pm-rust must track the current pm CLI. This task bumps the oracle pin (package.json + committed lockfile), updates COMPATIBLE_PM_VERSION and docs references, runs the full gate, and classifies every parity delta between 10.14 and 10.19 as intended upstream change, upstream bug kept at parity, or native defect. Supersedes the open Dependabot oracle bumps."
